      "signature": "uint GetCelFileInfoHeight(CelFileInfo * pCelFileInfo)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "uint",
      "comment": "Returns the height field from a CelFileInfo structure.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pCelFileInfo pointer is not NULL\n2. If NULL: Log error via FogAssertFail and terminate process\n3. Return pCelFileInfo->height (offset 0xc)\n\nParameters:\n- pCelFileInfo (CelFileInfo*): Pointer to CelFileInfo structure; must not be NULL\n\nReturns:\n- uint: The height field value from the CelFileInfo structure\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x579 (1401): Error code/line number for assert failure logging\n- 0xFFFFFFFF (-1): Termination exit code",
