      "name": "GetSkillData",
      "signature": "void * GetSkillData(int nSkillId)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void *",
      "comment": "Get skill data table entry from skill ID.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if skill ID is zero/null\n2. If zero: call FogAssertFail, then terminate\n3. If non-zero: return field at offset 0x18 from skill table entry\n\nParameters:\n- nSkillId (int): Skill ID to look up (0 is invalid, triggers error)\n\nReturns:\n- void*: Pointer to skill data structure at offset 0x18 of skill table entry\n- On error: Function terminates process if skill ID is 0\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x18: Offset of skill data pointer within skill table entry\n- 0x60c: Line number in source file for assert\n- 0xffffffff: Termination code",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
