      "name": "DestroyGameDataCollectionContents",
      "signature": "void DestroyGameDataCollectionContents(GameDataCollection * pThis)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Destroys all contents of a GameDataCollection and its associated hash tables and arrays.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Setup structured exception handling with handler at 0x6fba42b5\n2. Install primary vtable pointer (DestroyGameDataObject at 0x6fba63ec)\n3. Set exception state to 2 for initial cleanup phase\n4. Destroy hash objects at offset 0x40: repeatedly call FUN_6fadc7c0() and Ordinal_403() with TSHashObjectChunk signature until count reaches zero\n5. Destroy game data objects at offset 0x30: repeatedly call FUN_6fadc310() and Ordinal_403() with AUSGAMEDATA signature until count reaches zero\n6. Set exception state to 3 for hash entry cleanup phase\n7. Destroy hash entries at offset 0x3c: repeatedly call FUN_6fadc380() on (buffer + count) addresses until count reaches zero\n8. Set exception state to 1 for linked list cleanup phase\n9. Process hash entry linked list at offset 0x3c: if non-null, call FUN_6fadc6f0() to unlink, copy link pointer, store count, then zero both pointer and count\n10. Set exception state to 4 for second hash cleanup phase\n11. Destroy hash entries at offset 0x2c: repeatedly call FUN_6fadc380() on (buffer + count) addresses until count reaches zero\n12. Process second hash entry linked list at offset 0x2c: if non-null, call FUN_6fadc6f0() to unlink, copy link pointer, store count, then zero both pointer and count\n13. Install secondary vtable pointer (DestroyGameDataObject at 0x6fba63dc)\n14. Zero field at offset 0x10\n15. Set exception state to 6 for array cleanup phase\n16. Call FUN_6fadc740() to destroy data structure at offset 0x4\n17. Destroy array elements: for each array slot (stride 0xc), repeatedly call FUN_6fadc720() and FUN_6fadc380() on entries until count reaches zero\n18. Set exception state to 5 for finalization phase\n19. Call FUN_6fadc510() to destroy data structure at offset 0x14\n20. Set exception state to 7 for final cleanup phase\n21. Call FUN_6fadc740() to destroy data structure at offset 0x4\n22. Set exception state to 0xffffffff for completion\n23. Call FUN_6fadc380() to destroy data structure at offset 0x8\n24. Restore previous exception list and return\n\nParameters:\npThis (GameDataCollection*) - Pointer to GameDataCollection object to destroy contents of\n\nReturns:\nvoid - No return value",
