      "name": "ConvertCelFileTo8BitPalette",
      "signature": "void ConvertCelFileTo8BitPalette(int nSrcCel, int nDestCel, void * pfnColorLookup, uint dwTransparentColor)",
      "calling_convention": "__fastcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Converts 24-bit RGB CEL file frames to 8-bit palettized format.\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Validates source CEL has CELFILE_24BIT flag (bit 2)\\n2. Iterates through all frames (width * height at src+0x10, src+0x14)\\n3. For each frame, allocates temp buffer (0xd4 alloc code)\\n4. Converts each RGB pixel via callback function\\n5. Compresses palettized data via CompressItemDataLine\\n6. Allocates dest frame struct (0x20 header + compressed data)\\n7. Copies frame header fields and compressed data to dest\\n8. Stores dest frame pointer in parallel dest array\\n\\nParameters:\\n- nSrcCel (int): Pointer to source 24-bit CEL structure\\n- nDestCel (int): Pointer to destination CEL structure\\n- pfnColorLookup (void*): RGB to palette index callback\\n- dwTransparentColor (uint): 24-bit RGB treated as transparent\\n\\nReturns:\\n- void: No return value, dest CEL populated in-place",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:cd0b308f18421923686b0957113ef7d3",
