      "name": "GetCachedTextHeight",
      "signature": "dword GetCachedTextHeight(dword * pTextData)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "dword",
      "comment": "Retrieves cached text height value from a text/window structure at offset 0x58.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Check if input pointer is null\n2. If null, call InitTileResource with tile handle, source path, and flag 0x83\n3. Return dword value from input pointer + offset 0x58\n\nParameters:\n- pTextData (dword*): Pointer to text data structure; NULL triggers cache init\n\nReturns:\n- Dword value from structure field at offset 0x58 (cached text height)\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x58 (88): Offset to text height field in structure\n- 0x83 (131): Initialization flag for tile resource",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
