      "name": "ResetLinkedList",
      "signature": "void ResetLinkedList(uint dwFlags)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Reset linked list structure and optionally process pending items.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. If g_dwLinkedListInitialized == 0, call cleanup handler and return\n2. If dwFlags != 0, call ProcessAndClearQueueItems to process pending items\n3. Zero out 13 dwords (52 bytes) of g_LinkedListHead structure\n4. Set g_dwLinkedListSize to 0\n5. Call cleanup handler to finalize state\n\nParameters:\n- dwFlags (uint): Control flag; nonzero triggers queue item processing before reset\n\nReturns:\n- void\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If uninitialized, exits after calling cleanup handler without clearing data\n- Queue structure is 52 bytes (13 dwords); cleared via STOSD.REP",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "CAL",
      "index": "CAL:4f03797238f81c061c10315d25d49aef",
