      "name": "ProcessTileProjectPixels",
      "signature": "void ProcessTileProjectPixels(TileProject * pTileProject, void * pfnRgbCallback)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Process all pixels in tile project and invoke callback function for each RGB value.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Validate pTileProject is not NULL; assert if NULL\n2. Check tile project dwFlags & 0x01 (TILEPROJECT_FLAG_PRESENT); assert if not set\n3. For each tile (nTileIndex < nTileCount at +0x10c):\n   a. Load pBaseAddr = pTileProject[+0x110] + nTileIndex * 0x60\n   b. For each sub-object (nSubIndex < pBaseAddr[+0x50]):\n      - Load pCurrentTile = pBaseAddr[+0x54] + nSubIndex * 0x14\n      - Load nPixelCount = (ushort)pCurrentTile[+0x0a]\n      - Load pbPixelData = pCurrentTile[+0x10]\n      - If nPixelCount > 0, calculate iteration count = (nPixelCount + 2) / 3\n      - For each iteration: assemble RGB and invoke callback\n\nParameters:\n- pTileProject (TileProject*): Pointer to tile project structure\n  - +0x04: dwFlags (bit 0 = validity flag)\n  - +0x10c: nTileCount\n  - +0x110: pTileArray\n- pfnRgbCallback (void*): Function pointer callback(dwRgbColor)\n\nReturns:\n- void; Terminates via assertion if preconditions violated\n\nMagic Numbers:\n- 0x60 (96): TileBase structure stride\n- 0x14 (20): SubTile structure stride\n- 0x01: TILEPROJECT_FLAG_PRESENT mask",
      "name_source": "LoD/1.07",
      "method": "STR",
      "index": "STR:33a3df900aaaaf98f22847d60d8f4fe9",
