      "name": "CalculateOffsetValue",
      "signature": "int CalculateOffsetValue(int nOffset, int * pValues)",
      "calling_convention": "__cdecl",
      "return_type": "int",
      "comment": "Calculates offset-adjusted value from parameter table with optional indirection.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load base value from pValues[0] and add nOffset\n2. Load indirect index from pValues[1]\n3. If index >= 0, perform indirection: fetch value at (pValues[1] + nOffset), dereference through pValues[2] offset table, add to result\n4. Return final calculated value\n\nParameters:\nnOffset - Offset/index to apply in calculations\npValues - Pointer to value array: [0]=base value, [1]=index, [2]=offset table address\n\nReturns:\nint - Calculated result value\n\nSpecial Cases:\n- If pValues[1] < 0, skip indirection and return only base value + offset\n- Indirection performs two-level lookup through offset table",
