      "name": "InitializeObjectBase",
      "signature": "undefined4 * InitializeObjectBase(undefined4 * pObject)",
      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "undefined4 *",
      "comment": "InitializeObjectBase - Initializes base structure of object instance with vftable and integrity check\\n\\nAlgorithm:\\n1. Load current FS:[0] exception handler frame pointer for safe restoration\\n2. Install SEH (Structured Exception Handling) frame with address 0x6fc3218a as exception handler\\n3. Call InitializeObjectNestedStructures() to perform deep initialization of nested object fields\\n4. Store virtual function table pointer (g_vftable_UnlinkListNode) at object offset +0x0\\n5. Compute bit-inverted integrity check: ~(object_address) & 0xFFFFFFF for corruption detection\\n6. Store integrity check value at offset +0x48 (pObject[0x12]) as 28-bit masked value\\n7. Zero out field at offset +0x4c (pObject[0x13]) for initialization/padding\\n8. Restore previous exception handler from stack to FS:[0] for clean exception handling exit\\n9. Return initialized object pointer to caller for constructor chaining\\n\\nParameters:\\npObject (undefined4*): Pointer to uninitialized object instance requiring minimum 0x50 bytes\\n    of writable memory. Function initializes offsets 0x0-0x4c; offset 0x50 used later for\\n    critical section by InitializeObjectInstance\\n\\nReturns:\\nundefined4*: Returns input pObject pointer after full initialization, enabling constructor chaining\\n\\nSpecial Cases:\\n- Uses SEH for exception safety during multi-phase initialization\\n- Bit-inverted integrity check (~addr & 0xFFFFFFF) provides simple runtime corruption detection\\n- Offset +0x48 stores 28-bit value (20-bit for 32-bit address space after masking)\\n- Called by InitializeObjectInstance which adds critical section at offset +0x50\\n- Virtual function table pointer identifies object type and enables dynamic dispatch\\n\\nStructure Layout:\\nOffset   Size   Field Name              Type        Description\\n0x0      4      vftable                 void*       Virtual function table pointer\\n0x48     4      integrityCheck          uint        Bit-inverted address check (~address & 0xFFFFFFF)\\n0x4c     4      padding                 uint        Zero-initialized padding/reserved field",
