      "calling_convention": "__stdcall",
      "return_type": "void",
      "comment": "Extracts and passes exception frame field to exception handler.\n\nAlgorithm:\n1. Load exception frame pointer from stack [EBP+4]\n2. Dereference to get base address\n3. Add 0x4 offset to access field\n4. Push field address as argument\n5. Call ExecuteWithExceptionHandler\n6. Return to caller\n\nParameters:\npExceptionFrame - Exception frame pointer\n\nReturns:\nvoid\n\nStructure Layout:\nThe function accesses offset +4 from the provided exception frame pointer.\nThis is part of the C++ exception unwinding infrastructure.\nFunction pointer table reference at 0x6fc3d0b0.",
